---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Compass from "../components/Compass.astro";
---
<Base title="Delete your Hona account" description="How to delete your Hona account and what happens to your data.">
  <section class="band-cream on-cream slip">
    <div class="shell slip__in" style="max-width:44rem">
      <div class="mark"><Compass state="st-none" plain={true} /></div>
      <h1 style="font-size:clamp(1.9rem,1.4rem+2vw,2.8rem)">Delete your account</h1>

      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem">
        You can delete your Hona account from inside the app. Open
        <strong>Administration</strong>, scroll to the bottom, and choose
        <strong>Cancel Subscription &amp; Delete Account</strong>. Deletion is
        immediate and cannot be undone.
      </p>

      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem">
        This removes your projects, receipts, budgets, progress photographs,
        stakeholder grants and account record. Records of draw requests a lender
        approved are retained with your identity removed, because a third party
        released funds against them — the transaction remains, nothing in it
        identifies you. This is set out in full in our
        <a href="/privacy" style="border-bottom:1px solid currentColor;text-decoration:none">Privacy Policy</a>.
      </p>

      <p class="fine" style="margin-top:2rem">
        If you can no longer sign in, write to
        <a href="mailto:support@honafinancial.com?subject=Account%20deletion%20request" style="border-bottom:1px solid currentColor;text-decoration:none">support@honafinancial.com</a>
        from the address on the account and we will delete it for you.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.35rem,1.2rem + .6vw,1.7rem);margin-top:3rem">Deleting individual data</h2>

      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem">
        You do not have to delete your account to remove data from Hona. Inside
        the app you can delete:
      </p>

      <ul style="text-align:left;max-width:34rem;margin:1.5rem auto 0;padding-left:1.2rem">
        <li style="margin-bottom:.4rem"><strong>Receipts</strong> — from the Staged page or from a receipt's detail screen. Deleting a receipt also deletes its photograph.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:.4rem"><strong>Progress photographs and before/after photographs</strong> — from the Progress Photos page for any phase.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:.4rem"><strong>Projects</strong> — from the Projects page.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:.4rem"><strong>Stakeholders</strong> — from Project Setup. Removing a stakeholder immediately ends their access to that project.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:.4rem"><strong>Phases and categories</strong> — from Project Setup.</li>
      </ul>

      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem">
        Deletion is immediate and cannot be undone. Your account, and anything
        you have not deleted, stays as it is.
      </p>

      <p class="fine" style="margin-top:2rem">
        If you cannot sign in, write to
        <a href="mailto:support@honafinancial.com?subject=Data%20deletion%20request" style="border-bottom:1px solid currentColor;text-decoration:none">support@honafinancial.com</a>
        from the address on the account and tell us what you would like removed.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
